    <string name="onboarding_intro">Your MP3s are already yours. You don\'t have to pay anyone to listen to them. And nobody gets to spy on you while you listen.\n\nPick ONE folder on your phone, or one on your Google Drive: ASD sifts through it, lines up the tracks and lets you make mixtapes. That\'s it.</string>
