    <string name="volume_hint">Each track is measured once (EBU R128, like ReplayGain 2.0) and played at -18 LUFS: no more volume jumps from one MP3 to the next. Louder tracks get turned down, so turn your phone up a bit. Files on Drive are only measured on Wi-Fi.</string>
