    <string name="manifesto">ASD = Anarchic Streaming Device.\nThe \"streaming\" goes from your memory to your ears, and that\'s it.\n\n· The network is only for Google Drive and the TUBE, and only if you use them.\n· No account, no ads, no tracking.\n· Playlists live on the phone. Deleting them doesn\'t touch the files.\n· ASD never deletes your files: to remove one, use the phone or Drive.\n· Cost: 0€. Forever.</string>
